### Update Display Name Endpoint Test

### Step 1: Create a new user to get credentials
POST {{host}}/api/{{api_version}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

### Copy the id and api_key from the response above

### Step 2: Update display name (replace USER_ID and API_KEY)
PUT {{host}}/api/{{api_version}}/user/name
Authorization: Bearer h94TvWWG1OjTYq1qM7NWcF9swAS+yX8PNpI25tyGlE8=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Cool Gamer"
}

###

### Step 3: Verify the update by getting user info
GET {{host}}/api/{{api_version}}/user/d18bb07f-52f5-4bc1-8f06-ff72eba49fe5

###

### Error case: Missing authorization (should return 401)
PUT {{host}}/api/{{api_version}}/user/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Hacker"
}

###

### Error case: Trying to update someone else's name (should return 403)
# First create a user, then try to update a different user's name
PUT {{host}}/api/{{api_version}}/user/name
Authorization: Bearer h94TvWWG1OjTYq1qM7NWcF9swAS+yX8PNpI25tyGlE8=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Sneaky"
}

###

### Error case: Empty display name (should return 400)
PUT {{host}}/api/{{api_version}}/user/name
Authorization: Bearer h94TvWWG1OjTYq1qM7NWcF9swAS+yX8PNpI25tyGlE8=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": ""
}

###

### Error case: Display name too long (should return 400)
PUT {{host}}/api/{{api_version}}/user/name
Authorization: Bearer h94TvWWG1OjTYq1qM7NWcF9swAS+yX8PNpI25tyGlE8=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "This is a very long display name that exceeds the maximum allowed length of sixty four characters"
}

###

### Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080
@api_version = v2
